  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a1wrxrK.png\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Epic Fight x ParCool！ 合作模組！</h1><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T-uMmLCYbn4?si=7SqKpApwtJMklmNF\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></em></span></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a></strong> 是一個先進的動畫庫，而 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/parcool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Parcool!</a></strong> 則加入了動態的玩家移動選項。如果這些創意專案在 Minecraft 世界中相遇，會發生什麼事呢…？</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CWsUfxt.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p><strong>動畫</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n  <p>首先，你需要啟用 <strong>戰鬥模式</strong> 來啟動 <strong>基於 Epic Fight 的動畫</strong>（預設切換鍵為 R）</p>\n\n  <h4><strong>ParCool 原始動作</strong></h4>\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>疾跑</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pcD9Nql.gif\" alt=\"疾跑\" width=\"200\" height=\"225\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>貓撲</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p02y9o2.gif\" alt=\"貓撲\" width=\"201\" height=\"226\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>翻滾</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2iclAMJ.gif\" alt=\"翻滾\" width=\"199\" height=\"178\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>攀牆/爬牆</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tN8ZuxC.gif\" alt=\"抓牆與爬牆\" width=\"201\" height=\"208\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>翻越</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2qE05UQ.gif\" alt=\"翻越\" width=\"204\" height=\"237\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>俯衝與跳傘</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3hL1NyX.gif\" alt=\"俯衝與跳傘\" width=\"205\" height=\"235\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p><em>更多動畫請在遊戲中發現！</em></p>\n\n  <h4><strong>基於 ParCool 的獨特動作（僅在戰鬥模式中生效）</strong></h4>\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>連鎖移動</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DgW7RVu.gif\" alt=\"連鎖移動\" width=\"212\" height=\"289\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>牆面移動</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qAVatkM.gif\" alt=\"牆面移動\" width=\"213\" height=\"198\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div><p>此擴充模組需要同時安裝 <strong>Epic Fight</strong> 和 <strong>ParCool!</strong>。版本資訊請參閱檔案說明。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CWsUfxt.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f1c40f\"><strong>支援與合作夥伴</strong></span>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2724\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kTgYcrh.png\" alt=\"Sparked Host\">\n  </a>\n</p><p>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CWsUfxt.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/7c517b51-581a-48dc-9130-aaad326dbcb4\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNbAJwj8RHg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/f3358cb9-f3cd-46e7-9ed0-a90bc2b1b188\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/3f2de855-e926-4eb9-a20c-4c6f44828250\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fen%252flatest%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/23220c47-c1e5-4e2b-82aa-876a86d7ed1a\" alt=\"GitHub 文件\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>\n</p>",
